{"runId":"2026-10-31T11-31-02-552Z","seq":29,"at":"2026-10-31T11:32:37.274Z","type":"critic.revise","details":{"phase":"proposal","subject":{"artifactId":"proposal-C009-CH1-R0288","version":1},"issues":[{"category":"unsupported_claim","severity":"blocking","claim":"Nikolić’s research provides candidate methods: unified-script lemmatization, normalization of script boundaries within tokens, and retrieval experiments in which lemmatization with paradigm-aware indexing achieved the highest F1. These are research results, not demonstrated LinguaBot outcomes.","sources":[{"recordId":"SYN-PUB-03588","field":"abstract","quote":"The proposed system handles both scripts transparently by applying a unified internal representation before lemmatization, then restoring the original script in the output.","datasetVersion":"einstein-matchmaker-data@4fb99b3"},{"recordId":"SYN-PUB-03594","field":"abstract","quote":"We introduce a cross-script tokeniser that identifies script boundaries within tokens and normalises them before downstream processing","datasetVersion":"einstein-matchmaker-data@4fb99b3"},{"recordId":"SYN-PUB-03589","field":"abstract","quote":"Full lemmatization combined with paradigm-aware indexing yields the highest F1 score.","datasetVersion":"einstein-matchmaker-data@4fb99b3"}],"explanation":"Jev rates the support of this claim by its quoted evidence at 0.28; restate it to match the quote or remove it.","owner":"proposal_writer"},{"category":"unsupported_claim","severity":"blocking","claim":"Nikolić’s corpus-derived lexicon study reports lower paradigm correctness for borrowings than for common vocabulary: 78.6% versus 91.3%. Her participation record indicates openness to joint projects.","sources":[{"recordId":"SYN-PUB-03592","field":"abstract","quote":"finding 91.3% paradigm correctness for common vocabulary and 78.6% for borrowings.","datasetVersion":"einstein-matchmaker-data@4fb99b3"},{"recordId":"R0288","field":"open_to","quote":"joint projects","datasetVersion":"einstein-matchmaker-data@4fb99b3"}],"explanation":"Jev rates the support of this claim by its quoted evidence at 0.49; restate it to match the quote or remove it.","owner":"proposal_writer"}]}}
